WEBVTT

00:11:59.967 --> 00:12:01.039
(Applause)

00:12:01.063 --> 00:12:05.396
And I don't want my grandchildren

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.637
to have to fight
these battles all over again,

00:12:07.661 --> 00:12:09.222
and so I get more radical.

00:12:09.246 --> 00:12:11.828
The older I get, the more radical I get,

00:12:11.852 --> 00:12:15.045
because there are just some things
that we as adults have to do

00:12:15.069 --> 00:12:16.335
for the next generations.

00:12:16.359 --> 00:12:18.445
And I looked at
the sacrifices of Mrs. Hamer

00:12:18.469 --> 00:12:20.384
and all those people in Mississippi

00:12:20.408 --> 00:12:23.143
who risked their lives
to give us a better life.

00:12:23.167 --> 00:12:25.319
But the United States
has got to come to grips

00:12:25.343 --> 00:12:27.987
with its failure to invest
in its children,

00:12:28.011 --> 00:12:31.224
and it's the Achilles' heel
of this nation.